{"question": "Will Turkey and Pakistan fight for Saudi Arabia?", "country": "SA", "voice_speed": 0.95, "gap": 0.4, "hook": true, "hook_lines": ["ATTACK ON ONE = ALL", "Saudi, Turkey, Pakistan"], "cover": ["ATTACK ON ONE.", "ATTACK ON ALL.", "WHO JOINS?"], "region": "SAUDI / YEMEN", "places": {"RIYADH": {"id": "RIYADH", "name": "Riyadh", "lat": 24.71, "lon": 46.68}, "ANKARA": {"id": "ANKARA", "name": "Turkey", "lat": 39.93, "lon": 32.86}, "ISLAMABAD": {"id": "ISLAMABAD", "name": "Pakistan", "lat": 33.68, "lon": 73.05}, "SANAA": {"id": "SANAA", "name": "Sanaa", "lat": 15.35, "lon": 44.21}, "TAIF": {"id": "TAIF", "name": "Taif", "lat": 21.27, "lon": 40.42}, "YANBU": {"id": "YANBU", "name": "Yanbu", "lat": 24.09, "lon": 38.06}, "MOCHA": {"id": "MOCHA", "name": "Mocha", "lat": 13.32, "lon": 43.25}}, "lines": [{"text": "Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan are arranging urgent talks between their military chiefs.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera / The National, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "flow", "from": "RIYADH", "to": ["ANKARA", "ISLAMABAD"], "label": "Urgent military talks"}}, {"text": "It falls under the Mecca defence pact, signed on 7 August.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Mecca pact.", "Signed 7 Aug.", "3 countries."], "flag": "SA"}}, {"text": "The pact says an attack on one of them is an attack on all.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Attack on one", "= attack on all."], "flag": "SA"}}, {"text": "No date is set, and the kind of support is not named.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Date: not set.", "Support: not named."], "flag": "SA"}}, {"text": "The trigger: Saudi Arabia says it shot down six ballistic missiles fired from Yemen.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "flow", "from": "SANAA", "to": ["TAIF", "YANBU"], "label": "6 missiles shot down"}}, {"text": "The Houthis claim they hit a target in Riyadh and Aramco sites in Yanbu.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "YANBU", "head": "Houthi claim: Aramco", "notes": ["Riyadh + Yanbu", "not confirmed"]}}, {"text": "The coalition says any further escalation will be dealt with firmly.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "quote", "quote": "dealt with firmly", "who": "Turki al-Malki", "flag": "SA"}}, {"text": "Pakistan is the only one with nuclear weapons: about 170 warheads, SIPRI estimates.", "src": [2], "context": false, "note": "SIPRI Yearbook 2026", "scene": {"type": "number", "value": "170", "label": "Pakistani warheads", "detail": "SIPRI, Jan 2026", "flag": "PK"}}, {"text": "Inside Yemen, an AFP tally says at least 150 fighters were killed in 24 hours.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "AFP via Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "number", "value": "150+", "label": "fighters killed, 24h", "detail": "AFP tally, Yemen", "flag": "YE"}}, {"text": "The Houthis have taken the port of Mocha, on the Bab al-Mandeb strait.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Al Jazeera, 25 Sep", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "MOCHA", "head": "Mocha taken", "notes": ["Bab al-Mandeb", "Red Sea coast"]}}, {"text": "About 12 percent of global trade normally passes through it.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "AP via Al Jazeera", "scene": {"type": "number", "value": "12%", "label": "of global trade", "detail": "Bab al-Mandeb", "flag": "YE"}}, {"text": "The UN says more than 230,000 people have fled their homes this month.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "UNHCR via Al Jazeera", "scene": {"type": "number", "value": "230,000", "label": "displaced since 1 Sep", "detail": "UNHCR, Yemen", "flag": "YE"}}, {"text": "One pact. Three armies. One nuclear power. Will Turkey and Pakistan send troops?", "src": [], "context": true, "note": "", "scene": {"type": "wide"}}], "sources": [{"n": 0, "outlet": "Al Jazeera", "title": "Saudi, Turkish, Pakistani chiefs plan urgent talks amid Yemen fighting", "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/25/saudi-turkish-pakistani-chiefs-plan-urgent-talks-amid-yemen-fighting"}, {"n": 1, "outlet": "The National", "title": "Saudi Arabia, Pakistan and Turkey plan urgent military meeting as Grand Mufti calls on troops to fight Houthis", "url": "https://www.thenationalnews.com/news/mena/2026/09/25/saudi-arabia-pakistan-and-turkey-plan-urgent-military-meeting-as-grand-mufti-calls-on-troops-to-fight-houthis/"}, {"n": 2, "outlet": "SIPRI", "title": "SIPRI Yearbook 2026 summary: World nuclear forces, January 2026", "url": "https://www.sipri.org/sites/default/files/2026-06/yb26_summary_en_0.pdf"}], "caption": "Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan are planning urgent talks between their military chiefs after new Houthi missile attacks. Their pact says an attack on one is an attack on all, and Pakistan has nuclear weapons. Will they send troops?", "hashtags": ["saudiarabia", "pakistan", "houthis", "yemen", "outpost"]}